File Roles

main.py
- Overall initialization
- Register Bridge functions
- Start TCP/STT/Hugging Face worker threads
- Run App.run

config.py
- Hugging Face model/token/system message/RAG/hardware settings

state.py
- Global state shared by multiple modules
- Queue, Lock, latest R code, module registration information

nli_protocol.py
- Parse/generate [①|②|③|④|⑤|⑥] codes

module_handler.py
- Process I/R received from C++
- Save latest R
- Insert external LLM requests into the queue
- Register receive_module_info Bridge

stt.py
- arecord recording
- RMS decision
- Google STT
- Insert the user's voice into the latest R code

tts.py
- Generate gTTS MP3
- Convert to WAV and play with aplay

hf_client.py
- Call Hugging Face Inference Providers API
- Combine system message, recent conversation memory, and RAG data
- Parse NLI response, deliver commands to C++, and speak narration with TTS

rag.py
- Load CSV/XLSX/TXT files in the knowledge folder
- Search rows related to the question
- Insert related data into the system message

create_knowledge_table.py
- Generate an example module_knowledge.xlsx table

tcp_client.py
- ESP TCP connection/reconnection
- ESP send/receive
- Register send_to_esp Bridge

bridge_io.py
- Python -> C++ Bridge.call function
